>Αριάγνη (Ακυβέρνητες πολιτείες, #2)"�
�Taken from the poverty of her parents' home in Portsmouth, Fanny Price is brought up with her rich cousins at Mansfield Park, acutely aware of her humble rank and with her cousin Edmund as her sole ally. During her uncle's absence in Antigua, the Crawford's arrive in the neighborhood bringing with them the glamour of London life and a reckless taste for flirtation. Mansfield Parkis considered Jane Austen's first mature work and, with its quiet heroine and subtle examination of social position and moral integrity, one of her most profound."�
�Oi "Akubernetes Politeies" apartizontai apo treis tomous: "E leskhe" (1961), "Ariagne" (1962), "E nukhterida" (1965). E drase topotheteitai antistoikha sten Ierousalem, sto Kairo, sten Alexandreia. Ena muthistorema pou tithaseuei aristotekhnika mia kheimarrode istorike ule, dinontas anthropine phone sto epos kai sto drama tou B Pagkosmiou Polemou, ten ora pou krinotan to mellon ton laon kai paikhteke sta zaria e tukhe tes Elladas. Khare se poikiles anadromes, e trilogia zontaneuei kai progenesteres periodous, apo ton Mesopolemo, ton khloro paradeiso tes ephebeias me ta prota erotika skirtemata kapoion eroon, os ten palia Aigupto, anakalontas mnemes progonon. To ergo koruphonetai me ten exegerse tou Stratou kai tou Stolou, to kinema tou Aprile 1944 kai te dramatike katastole tou, eno, me ton epilogo tou g tomou, metapheromaste ste Thessalonike meta ton Emphulio, to 1954, opou akougetai ena sugklonistiko rekbiem gia tous khamenous agonistes.
Ostoso, o Tsirkas den egrapse khroniko, alla ergo tekhnes. Istorike akribeia kai phantasia spania denontai s' ena toso armoniko sunolo. Kinontas stibara megalous ogkous, katagraphei euaistheta tis apekheseis ton gegonoton ste suneidese kai stis skheseis ton anthropon, plathontas olozontanes morphes pou tha meinoun sto pantheon ton muthistorematikon eroon. Politikes mekhanorraphies, akhalinotes philodoxies mesa ste dine tou polemou, alla kai oraia oneira kai perisseuma anthropias kai gennaiotetas dinoun to stigma ton "Akuberneton Politeion", opou o erotas, kuriarkhos, tuligei kai xetuligei to nema mias sunarpastikes plokes. Parallela, me ten poluphonia tes aphegeses kai alles neoterikes tekhnotropies, o suggrapheas katorthonei na sugkhoneusei ton monternismo me ten paradose. Ena metaikhmiako ergo, pou sphragise ta ellenika grammata s' auto ton "suntomo 20o aiona"."�
�E istoria tes Daphnes kai tou Tzonu einai mia alethine istoria, pou o suggrapheas ten ezese sten ephebeia tou "nukhta pros nukhta".
Ksetuligetai sto "Rits", ena kampare tou 51, me ta saxophona na skepazoun ton apoekho tou Emphuliou ki enan Amerikano axiomatiko na zei to romantiko tou pathos me mia amartole Ellenida -ten ora pou e kubernese Plastera upographei ten ektelese tou Mpelogianne.
Ola auta moiazoun na men ekhoun kamia skhese metaxu tous ki omos einai oi krikoi tes idias alusidas. E Daphne den exere tipota gia ten epokhe tes, alla kapoia stigme tha plerone to timema tes, me ton idio tropo pou to pleronan tote osoi amakhoi skotonontan apo adespotes sphaires.
E istoria tes moiazei se polla me ten istoria tes Noras, tou Stathe, tes Olgas, tou Leonida kai ton allon agrimion pou kuklophoroun guro tes, stis selides tou bibliou autou. Einai e khamene genia. E pio sosta, oi anupopsiastoi mias khamenes genias.
Oi <>einai to proto biblio tou Phrentu Germanou -to egrapse anamesa sta 17 kai sta 26 tou khronia, alla den to tupose giati den ebriske ekdote. "Tote nomiza oti egrapha diegemata", leei ston prologo tou. "Tora, blepontas to ap ten alle akre tou tounel, niotho oti egrapsa, pali, ena biblio epokhes. Mono pou edo oi eroes, ta istorika prosopa tou bibliou, einai anthropoi pou tous aggixa, sta 17 mou khronia, pou perpatesa dipla tous kai pou kapoia stigme skoupisa m ena manteli ta dakrua tous. Tote den eikhame akoma khartomantela..."�

�
<>. Skephtesai ekeines tis ippotikes muthistories me tous megalous erotes, tis peripeteies, otan oi erastes khanontai kai anazetountai diaskhizontas ton kosmo. Etsi, bebaia, ki e Elene phtanei sta perata tes Ges gia na xanasmixei me to muthiko arraboniastiko. Monakha pou oi semerinoi eroes den ekhoun na palepsoun me drakontes kai me kastropurgous alla me tis sumplegades tes Istorias. Aute orizei te moira tous, ruthmizei kai tis erotikes sumperiphores, plathei protupa e thamponei ten lampse ton anthropon. Ston diplo isto, loipon, tes prosopikes kai tes sullogikes peripeteias, pleketai abiasta to muthistorema. Prosopa, koina, atheletoi protagonistes e anideoi komparsoi tou dramatos: Antistase, Emphulios, dioxeis. Megala oramata kai diapseuseis, dialuse pollon pseudaistheseon. E Ellada, o kosmos. S' ena metaikhmio tes zoes tes kai tes prosphates istorias mas -ste diarkeia tes diktatorias- <>, anasurontas tis mnemes tes, petradi to petradi, sunthetei to psephidoto mias triakontaetias. Euthrauste ki omos agerokhe, mprosta s' ena aoristo ki ostoso pali kathorismeno mellon, milaei khoris pikria, khoris metameleia, me zestasia, kapote me khioumor, me mia truphere phrontida, tha 'leges, na me gumnosei to parelthon, te zoe tes kai te zoe. E anthropine phone tes Alkes Zee. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"�
�Os mikre autobiographia, to biblio auto aph'enos einai empotismeno me iatrikes leptomereies pou eidikoi kai me tha broun akros endiapherouses kai aph'eterou ekhei os kentriko thema kai menuma oti o Theos steketai piso apo kathe therapeia. Men perimenete bebaia oute phanatismous oute threskeutike katekhese. Aplos tha deite ten pepoithese tou suggrapheos oti piso apo kathe iatriko thauma e sumptose e anthropine kalosune brisketai e skia tou Theou.
PEGE:http://almurofustiki.com/pisw-mas-ste..."�
�O erotas, e anazetese tou erota, o pothos tou erota... Tria kalokairia mesa sto lampro phos tes Attikes, treis adelphes sten anthese tous, e Maria, e Inphanta, e Katerina. E Maria, e megalutere, aisthesiake, konta sta musteria tes phuses, e Inphanta, phlogere alla sugkratemene mprosta ston erota, e Katerina, dipsasmene gia anexartesia, pou dialegei to oneiro. Gi' auten o muthos ginetai e pragmatikoteta, opos ta musteriode prosopa tes Polonezas giagias kai tou kapetaniou Andrea. E Katerina aphegeitai ta tria auta kalokairia me phantasia, khioumor kai aperante trupheroteta, me neanike khare pou ekhei kiolas enan tono nostalgias."�
�
Mpaineis se demosia uperesia kai zetas eugenika na ta kaneis ola poutana. E kopela stis plerophories se stelnei sto grapheio 314 ston trito oropho, opou gria upallelos milaei sto telephono. Epikheireis na te diakopseis, apotugkhaneis, deka lepta argotera kleinei to telephono kai se rotaei tsantismene an perases prota apo to protokollo, esu les okhi me apologetiko uphos, gria se stelnei protokollo, meta grapheio 5, meta tameio kai sto telos pali edo. Pas protokollo, thlimmene upallelos graphei arithmo se khartaki kai sou to dinei khoris na se koitaxei pote. Pegaineis grapheio 5, pairneis khartaki proteraiotetas, perimeneis 45 lepta, erkhetai e seira sou, antras upallelos me bromere maskhale se rotaei poios se esteile edo, den thumasai, upallelos brizei aorista, alla telos panton, sou kanei te khare na se exuperetesei. Les eukharisto khoris na uparkhei logos, katebaineis sto tameio, terastia oura, rotas ton teleutaio "gia na ta kanete ola poutana perimenete;", sou gnephei kourasmena nai, pernane ores, erkhetai mesemeri, to tameio kleinei, oi polites diamarturontai, oi upalleloi lene oti den phtaine ekeinoi, ta parapona sas ston upourgo. Polites pheugoun brizontas kai tha xanaerthoun aurio na stethoun apo tis 6 to proi sten oura, giati e prothesmia gia na ta kaneis ola poutana legei methaurio. Telos tes istorias.
Sumperasma: Den einai autos o sostos tropos gia na ta kaneis ola poutana."	�G�z
